# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  BRANDING / REBRANDING — set these to point a fork at your own
#  project instead of the original Kasalix. All values are optional;
#  the official build uses the defaults in src/config.ts.
#  Copy this file to `.env` (or set them in your build pipeline).
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# GitHub repository in "owner/name" form for feedback links. If the
# release repository is not set, this also overrides the release source.
# VITE_GITHUB_REPO=YourName/YourFork

# Repository containing releases and changelogs, when different from feedback.
# VITE_GITHUB_RELEASE_REPO=YourName/YourReleases
# Electron's main-process updater uses the KASALIX_RELEASE_REPO environment
# variable instead (or the existing KASALIX_REPO override).

# Base URL of the community poll website. The poll definition and
# live counts are served by this site's /api/poll endpoint.
# VITE_POLL_SITE_URL=https://your-site.example.com

# Full poll API endpoint (defaults to <POLL_SITE_URL>/api/poll).
# VITE_POLL_API_URL=https://your-site.example.com/api/poll
